---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="TriAxis Methodology - Bias Classification | AI BIAIS" description="Discover the TriAxis Taxonomy: a structural classification of AI biases based on origin, lifecycle, and specific nature.">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ibi-night text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20" style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #2D46F5 0%, transparent 70%)"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-6">Methodology · Taxonomy</p>
        <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-tight mb-6">
          The <span class="text-gradient-ibi">TriAxis Taxonomy</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Each bias is classified according to 3 orthogonal axes that answer 3 simple questions: Where does the bias come from, at what stage does it occur, and what is its specific nature.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#Axes" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 font-display font-semibold rounded-lg gradient-ibi text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
            Explore les 3 Axes
            <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          </a>
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- POURQUOI TRIAXIS -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">Pourquoi TriAxis</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">A classification that stands the test of time</h2>
      <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <p class="text-ibi-fg2 mb-4">Most existing taxonomies classify biases by symptom (what the bias does) or by domain (health, justice, recruitment...). These approaches are useful but they age poorly: new biases constantly appear in new contexts.</p>
      </p>
      <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">
        TriAxis adopts a structural approach: it describes each bias by 3 fundamental properties that depend neither on the domain nor on the technology. A bias remains classifiable in the same way whether it is detected in 2020 or 2035.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-xl mb-4">O</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Origin</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">Where does the bias come from? 3 possibilités : Systemic, computational, or human-cognitive.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-xl mb-4">L</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Lifecycle</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">At what stage of the AI Lifecycle? 6 stages from L1 (Historical) to L6 (Deployment).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-xl mb-4">S</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Specific</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">What is the specific nature? 28 categories from S01 (proxy) to S28 (interaction).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LES 3 Axes -->
  <section id="Axes" class="bg-ibi-arctic py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">Les 3 Axes</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Details of Axes O, L, and S</h2>
      </div>

      <!-- AXE O -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-2xl">O</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl">Origin Axis</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3">Where does the bias come from?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">O1</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Systemic</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">The bias is embedded in social, historical, or institutional structures. It precedes AI and is reflected in its data.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">O2</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">computational</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">The bias arises from the algorithm itself: model choice, optimization, data representation, feedback loops.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">O3</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Humain-cognitive</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">The bias comes from the cognitive biases of designers, annotators, or users: anchoring, confirmation, availability.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AXE L -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-2xl">L</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl">Lifecycle Axis</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3">À quelle étape du Lifecycle IA?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L1</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Historical</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Historical data, archives, past corpora carrying traces of the past.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L2</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Representation</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Choice of variables, encoding, tokenization, representation vectors.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L3</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Measurement</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Metrics, thresholds, labels. What is measured determines what the model learns.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L4</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Aggregation</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Data fusion, weighting, averages that perpetuate disparities.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L5</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Evaluation</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Choice of test sets, performance metrics, acceptance thresholds.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L6</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Deployment</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Production release, usage drift, feedback loops, progressive degradation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AXE S -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-2xl">S</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl">Specific Axis</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3">Quelle est la nature précise du biais?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 mb-6">
            28 categories covering all bias mechanisms identified in the literature. EXAMPLES:
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-sm">
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S01</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Proxy</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S02</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Feedback</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S03</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Selection</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S04</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Sampling</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S05</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Annotation</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S07</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Distribution shift</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S10</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Automation</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S24</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Institutional</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3 mt-4 italic">
            Complete list in the database (28 categories).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- IBI score -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">SCORING SYSTEM</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">The IBI Score</h2>
      <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Each bias receives an <strong class="text-ibi-fg">IBI score</strong> (0 à 10) calculated from 4 quantitative dimensions : Severity, Frequency, magnitude of impacted groups, and difficulty of Detection.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">⚠️</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Severity</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">From 1 (minor) to 5 (critical). Potential impact on individuals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔁</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Frequency</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">Rare, occasional, frequent, systematic.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">👥</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Group magnitude</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">Number of impacted protected groups (1 to 5).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔍</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Detection</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">Difficulty to identify the bias (1 = easy, 5 = very difficult).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-ibi-arctic rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-8">
      <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-6">Severity scale (Official levels)</h3>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-red-200">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-600 shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm w-32">5 - Critical</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 flex-1">Direct risk to fundamental rights. Deployment to be prohibited or restricted.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm w-32">4 - Severe</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 flex-1">Significant discrimination identified. Mandatory correction.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-yellow-200">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400 shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm w-32">3 - Moderate</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 flex-1">Measurable but limited discrepancy. Monitoring and documentation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-green-200">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm w-32">1 to 2 - Low</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 flex-1">Marginal impact. Continuous improvement.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EXEMPLE PRATIQUE -->
  <section class="bg-ibi-night text-white py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">Exemple</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">TriAxis in action</h2>
        <p class="text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed">Here is how a classic bias is described with TriAxis.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-ibi-marine rounded-2xl border border-ibi-border p-8 md:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <span class="font-display font-mono text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded bg-ibi-primary/20 text-ibi-primary">IBI-0002</span>
          <span class="font-display font-mono text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded bg-red-500/20 text-red-400">Score 9.0</span>
          <span class="font-display font-mono text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300">Critical</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-3">Discriminatory proxy bias</h3>
        <p class="text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Apparently neutral variable serving as a statistical substitute for a protected attribute.
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Origin</div>
            <div class="font-display font-semibold text-white mb-1">O2_computational</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3">Rooted in the algorithm and variable selection.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Lifecycle</div>
            <div class="font-display font-semibold text-white mb-1">L3_Measurement</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3">Manifests in the choice of metrics.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Specific</div>
            <div class="font-display font-semibold text-white mb-1">S01_proxy</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3">Substitution by correlated variable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA FINAL -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="gradient-ibi rounded-2xl p-12 text-center text-white">
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Explore the database</h2>
      <p class="text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        250 biases, 68 Regulations, 21 analytical views. Everything is searchable, citable, and open.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        
        <a href="/en/api" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 font-display font-semibold rounded-lg border-2 border-white/30 text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
          Documentation API
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
